; RR5-X1 (SF-RR5, October 21, 2026): both rows WRAP. An HBox's minimum width is
; the SUM of its children, so the four answers (SF-RR4's priced Trust arm the
; longest) held the panel ~1,050 px wide at any Interface Scale: at 2.0 the
; dialog ran off both edges of an 800-px window, half of Trust and of Cancel
; off-screen. A flow row's minimum is its widest child; the war-detail
; popup's row took the same cure on July 18, 2026.
